		(property "Note" "The band's nPM1304 stops at 100 mA; this one charges at 32 to 800 mA and has the same 32 pins. Set about 225 mA, half the cell's capacity per hour. BUCK2 unused: VSET2 grounded as documented; SW2 open and VOUT2 grounded are not confirmed. LED0-2, GPIO2-4 left open: not confirmed. CC1 and CC2 grounded: the input limit starts at 100 mA and firmware must raise it each time the charger is connected" (at 76.20 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
